%article.sign-in
  %h1 Halt! Who goes there?

  %p
    You are about to access an area that requires you verify you are the account holder.
    To do this, we require you to input a code that we can either send to you via SMS, or
    that is provided by an authenticator app if you have one configured.

  = link_to 'Proceed to verification', users_two_factor_verification_path, method: :post